#━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# VELU'S FASHTOWN BACKEND — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit `.env`.
#━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

#─── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

#─── MongoDB (two databases, one per connection) ───────────────────────
# admin   -> catalog + staff data (Admin, Product, Category, Collection,
#            Order, Customer, Inventory, Counter)
# website -> per-website storefront data (Website, homepage sections,
#            navigation, banners, coupons, offers, reviews, etc.)
MONGODB_ADMIN_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/velus_fashtown_admin
MONGODB_WEBSITE_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/velus_fashtown_website

#─── JWT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-different-long-random-string

#─── Admin Credentials (used for seeding) ─────────────────────────────
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@velusfashtown.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=Admin@123
ADMIN_FORCE_RESET=false

#─── Frontend / Backend URLs ──────────────────────────────────────────
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000

#─── Mail (SMTP) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MAIL_HOST=smtp.example.com
MAIL_PORT=587
MAIL_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTH=false
MAIL_USER=
MAIL_PASS=
MAIL_FROM="VELU'S FASHTOWN <no-reply@example.com>"

#─── Cloudinary (Media) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
CLOUDINARY_URL=

#─── Razorpay (Payments) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

#─── Shiprocket (Shipping) ────────────────────────────────────────────
SHIPROCKET_EMAIL=
SHIPROCKET_PASSWORD=
SHIPROCKET_PICKUP_LOCATION=

#─── CORS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
